            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eh’ ico nabonye n’iki kimwe gusa, n’ukw Imana yaremye abantu bagororotse; ariko bo birondereye ivyo bigeneye vyinshi.",
          "type": "text",
